#{
  // page floats (plan P3-15): in place on screen; on paged sheets a top
  // float goes to the top of its sheet, a bottom float to its foot, a page
  // float to a sheet of floats after its sheet
  $.set({role: 'topnote'}, {place: {float: 'top'}, box: {border: '1px', padding: '0.2em'}})
  $.set({role: 'bottomnote'}, {place: {float: 'bottom'}, box: {border: '1px', padding: '0.2em'}})
  $.set({role: 'pagenote'}, {place: {float: 'page'}})
}

= Page floats

Filler paragraph one fills the first part of the sheet with ordinary running text.

#!topnote
A float for the top of its sheet.
#topnote!

Filler paragraph two, after the top float in the source, before it on the sheet.

#!bottomnote
A float for the foot of its sheet.
#bottomnote!

Filler paragraph three, which the bottom float leaves behind in the source.

#!pagenote
A float that waits for a sheet of floats.
#pagenote!

The last paragraph.
